MDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":6,"created_at":"2025-08-11T05:35:48Z","updated_at":"2025-09-20T02:00:59Z","closed_at":"2025-09-20T02:00:43Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109512","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109512","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109512.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109512.patch","merged_at":"2025-09-20T02:00:42Z"},"body":"Fixes one of the issues in #107123.\r\n\r\nThe `SceneTreeDock` `Tree` ends up being one of the main sources of lag on large scenes. The three bottlenecks end up being `create_child`, `_is_sibling_branch_selected`, and text shaping. \r\n- `create_child` can benefit greatly from the `children_cache` that already exists, it just needs to use it.\r\n- `_is_sibling_branch_selected` is called wastefully, causing O(n^2) behavior on the number of siblings. If we only call it when the value might have changed, we can turn it into O(n) total across all calls, instead. \r\n- Text shaping improvements are handled in #109516\r\n\r\nHere's a flamegraph from #107123 showing the `create_child` bottleneck (with PR #109514 already applied to handle the other problem):\r\n<img width=\"2513\" height=\"1280\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/10773141-bbaa-41d9-b229-68029ac0ae62\" />\r\n\r\nHere's the after:\r\n<img width=\"2530\" height=\"1329\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f175dc71-a79d-4597-a3d2-96c3d1826754\" />\r\n\r\nThe `create_child` bottleneck came up a lot and could be pretty bad, sometimes upwards of 20 second editor hangs. The `is_sibling_branch_selected` slowdown was never the primary bottleneck, but once `create_child` was patched it did represent ~10% of cpu time on a couple operations and was a pretty clean change, so I included it.\r\n\r\n---------------------\r\n\r\nAll performance tests were run on builds made with the following command: `scons optimize=speed_trace debug_symbols=yes platform=linuxbsd dev_build=no production=yes`","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109512/reactions","total_count":55,"+1":28,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":10,"confused":0,"heart":3,"rocket":14,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109512/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}